": 1970151, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1686f.jpg"}, {"id": 1970152, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1686g.jpg"}, {"id": 1970153, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1686h.jpg"}, {"id": 1970154, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1686i.jpg"}], "slug": "nothing-belongs-here", "summary": "Nothing Belongs Here is a cozy first-person tidy-up game. Six worlds (a cottage, a wizard tower, a sci-fi lab, a modern flat, a western saloon and a haunted mansion) have collided in one town square, scattering 4,899 belongings across the ground. The player picks up objects, works out which world and which house each one came from, and places it on the one shelf row made for it. Placements and finished rows pay coins, which buy upgrades for carrying more, moving faster and spotting matches. Each house hides a small mini game that rewards a new ability. There is no timer and no fail state.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nothing-belongs-here"}